Well, any time you rest monsters can spawn.  Even if you're locked in
a closet they can spawn around you, if you rest too long there could
be many when you emerge.  My 2 strategies are either keep climbing up
towards the surface (monsters are weaker the higher you go), or rest
on an up staircase so I can climb if anything appears.  E-graving,
keeping pets near, and other normal tactics can help.  If you can find
a coaligned temple you'll get sanctuary (assuming you meet the not-too-
strenuous preconditions, I can't remember if it's happy god or
positive alignment).

Generally try to avoid really _needing_ it; retreat early, play hit-
and-run if you're faster than them, use missile weapos, pet dance,
spam E, and otherwise try to avoid getting low on HP.  Generally if
you're at 1/2 max HP you may have waited longer than you should to get
out of Dodge.


